<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">b <span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/b/</span></p>
</td>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">d <span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/d/</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr align="center">
<th rowspan="2" style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; "><a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fricative_consonant" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fricative_consonant" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">Fricative</a></p>
</th>
<th style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">voiceless</p>
</th>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">th <span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/θ/</span></p>
</td>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">lh <span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/ɬ/</span></p>
</td>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">sh <span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/ʃ/</span></p>
</td>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">h <span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/h/</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr align="center">
<th style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">voiced</p>
</th>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">zh <span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/ʒ/</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr align="center">
<th colspan="2" style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; "><a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rhotic_consonant" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rhotic_consonant" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">Rhotic</a></p>
</th>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">r <span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/r/</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr align="center">
<th colspan="2" style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; "><a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Approximant_consonant" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Approximant_consonant" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">Approximant</a></p>
</th>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">w <span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/w/</span></p>
</td>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">l <span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/l/</span></p>
</td>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">y <span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/j/</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 19px; text-align: -webkit-auto; ">Láadan lacks the <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Consonant" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Consonant" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">consonants</a> <span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/p, t, k, ɡ, s/</span>. However, it uses <i>b</i>, <i>d</i>, <i>sh</i> (<span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/ʃ/</span>), <i>m</i>, <i>n</i>, <i>l</i>, <i>r</i>, <i>w</i>, <i>y</i> (<span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/j/</span>), <i>h</i> with the same phonetic value as English. In addition to these, three <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Digraph_(orthography)" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Digraph_(orthography)" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">digraphs</a> require further explanation:</div>
<ul style="line-height: 19px; list-style-type: square; margin-top: 0.3em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 1.5em; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; list-style-image: url(http://127.0.0.1/w/extensions/FCKeditor/css/bullet.gif); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; text-align: -webkit-auto; "><li style="margin-bottom: 0.1em; "><i>th</i> – <span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/θ/</span>, a <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiceless_dental_fricative" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiceless_dental_fricative" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">voiceless dental fricative</a> (always as in English <i>think</i>, never as <i>then</i>),</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 0.1em; "><i>zh</i> – <span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/ʒ/</span>, a <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiced_postalveolar_fricative" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiced_postalveolar_fricative" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">voiced postalveolar fricative</a> (as English <i>plea<b>s</b>ure</i>),</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 0.1em; "><i>lh</i> – <span title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/ɬ/</span>, a <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiceless_alveolar_lateral_fricative" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiceless_alveolar_lateral_fricative" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">voiceless alveolar lateral fricative</a> (as <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Welsh_language" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Welsh_language" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">Welsh</a> <i>llan</i>).</li></ul>
<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 19px; text-align: -webkit-auto; "><b><font size="5">Grammar</font></b></div>
<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 19px; text-align: -webkit-auto; ">Most Láadan sentences contain three <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grammatical_particle" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grammatical_particle" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">particles</a>:</div>
<ul style="line-height: 19px; list-style-type: square; margin-top: 0.3em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 1.5em; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; list-style-image: url(http://127.0.0.1/w/extensions/FCKeditor/css/bullet.gif); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; text-align: -webkit-auto; "><li style="margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">The <i>speech-act</i> particle – this occurs at the beginning of the sentence and marks it as either a statement (<i>bíi</i>), a question (<i>báa</i>), <i>et cetera</i>; in connected speech or writing, this particle is often omitted. They are:
<dl style="margin-top: 0.2em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; "><dt style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Bíi </dt>
<dd style="line-height: 1.5em; margin-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Indicates a declarative sentence (usually optional)</dd>
<dt style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Báa </dt>
<dd style="line-height: 1.5em; margin-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Indicates a question</dd>
<dt style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Bó </dt>
<dd style="line-height: 1.5em; margin-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Indicates a command; very rare, except to small children</dd>
<dt style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Bóo </dt>
<dd style="line-height: 1.5em; margin-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Indicates a request; this is the usual imperative/"command" form</dd>
<dt style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Bé </dt>
<dd style="line-height: 1.5em; margin-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Indicates a promise</dd>
<dt style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Bée </dt>
<dd style="line-height: 1.5em; margin-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Indicates a warning</dd>
</dl>
</li></ul>
<ul style="line-height: 19px; list-style-type: square; margin-top: 0.3em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 1.5em; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; list-style-image: url(http://127.0.0.1/w/extensions/FCKeditor/css/bullet.gif); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; text-align: -webkit-auto; "><li style="margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">The <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grammatical_tense" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grammatical_tense" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">grammatical tense</a> particle – this occurs second in the sentence and marks it as either <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Present_tense" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Present_tense" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">present tense</a> (<i>ril</i>), <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Past_tense" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Past_tense" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">past tense</a> (<i>eril</i>), <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Future_tense" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Future_tense" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">future tense</a> (<i>aril</i>) or hypothetical (<i>wil</i>); without the tense particle, the sentence is assumed to have the same tense as the previous sentence.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">The <i>evidence</i> particle – this occurs at the end of statements and indicates the trustworthiness of the statement. They are:
<dl style="margin-top: 0.2em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; "><dt style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">wa </dt>
<dd style="line-height: 1.5em; margin-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Known to speaker because perceived by speaker, externally or internally</dd>
<dt style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">wi </dt>
<dd style="line-height: 1.5em; margin-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Known to speaker because self-evident</dd>
<dt style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">we </dt>
<dd style="line-height: 1.5em; margin-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Perceived by speaker in a dream</dd>
<dt style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">wáa </dt>
<dd style="line-height: 1.5em; margin-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Assumed true by speaker because speaker trusts source</dd>
<dt style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">waá </dt>
<dd style="line-height: 1.5em; margin-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Assumed false by speaker because speaker distrusts source; if evil intent by the source is also assumed, the form is "waálh"</dd>
<dt style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">wo </dt>
<dd style="line-height: 1.5em; margin-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Imagined or invented by speaker, hypothetical</dd>
<dt style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">wóo </dt>
<dd style="line-height: 1.5em; margin-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.1em; ">Used to indicate that the speaker states a total lack of knowledge as to the validity of the matter</dd>
</dl>
</li></ul>
<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 19px; text-align: -webkit-auto; ">Láadan is a <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Verb%E2%80%93subject%E2%80%93object" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Verb%E2%80%93subject%E2%80%93object" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">verb–subject–object</a> (VSO) language. <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Verb" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Verb" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">Verbs</a> and <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adjective" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adjective" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">adjectives</a> are interchangeable. There are no <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Article_(grammar)" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Article_(grammar)" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">articles</a>, and the object is marked by the <i>-th</i> or <i>-eth</i> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suffix" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suffix" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">suffix</a>. The <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plural" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plural" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">plural</a> number is shown only by the <i>me-</i> prefix to the verb (<i>wo-</i> is used in some versions of the language). The particle <i>ra</i> following a verb makes it negative.</div>
<table style="color: black; margin-left: 5px; border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; font-family: sans-serif; ">
<caption>Some basic sentences in Láadan</caption>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">Láadan</p>
</th>
<th style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">literal translation</p>
</th>
