<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">-(e)tho</p>
</td>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">customary or legal possessor</p>
</td>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; "><i>ebahid letho</i>: "my husband"</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">-(e)thi</p>
</td>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">possessor by chance</p>
</td>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; "><i>losh nethi</i>: "your money (gambling winnings)"</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">-(e)the</p>
</td>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">possessor by unknown provenance</p>
</td>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; "><i>ana worulethe</i>: "the cats' food"</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">-id</p>
</td>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; ">denotes male (otherwise female or gender neutral)</p>
</td>
<td style="border-top-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-right-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-bottom-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-left-color: rgb(211, 211, 211); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: dotted; border-right-style: dotted; border-bottom-style: dotted; border-left-style: dotted; border-image: initial; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0.4em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 5px; line-height: 1.5em; "><i>thul</i>: "mother/parent"; <i>thulid</i>: "father"</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 19px; text-align: -webkit-auto; ">The <i>speech act</i> particle, at the beginning of a sentence, can also carry several suffixes, which expand on the overall state of the sentence. For example, <i>bíi</i> begins a statement, but <i>bíide</i>begins a statement that is part of a narrative; <i>bóoth</i> begins a request made in pain; <i>báada</i> begins a question that is meant in jest.</div>
<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 19px; text-align: -webkit-auto; "><b><font size="4">Pronouns</font></b></div>
<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 19px; text-align: -webkit-auto; "><a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pronoun" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pronoun" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">Pronouns</a> in Láadan are built up from a number of constituent parts. The consonant <i>l</i> marks the <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grammatical_person" _fcksavedurl="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grammatical_person" style="color: rgb(0, 43, 184) !important; background-image: none; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; ">first person</a>, <i>n</i> the second person and <i>b</i> the third person. Usually, these are followed by the vowel <i>e</i>. However, the vowel <i>a</i> is used to designate someone who is loved (<i>lhe-</i> is prefixed to describe someone who is despised). The suffix <i>-zh</i> is used to mark a plural pronoun for numbers up to four, and <i>-n</i> for numbers beyond that. Therefore, <i>lazh</i> means "we, several beloved", and <i>lheben</i> means "they, many despised".</div>
